	=E2=80=9C\\[^\\]+$=E2=80=9D - Matches =E2=80=9C\Hello.exe=E2=80=9D=

	=E2=80=9C\w*(?=3D.exe$)=E2=80=9D - matches =E2=80=9CHello=E2=80=9D=
 (matches any word character before excluded =E2=80=9C.exe=E2=80=9D at =
end of line =E2=80=98$=E2=80=99)

